 ('thanjavur','Thanjavur',160,'1 day','Thanjavur, Kumbakonam, Pattukkottai, Orathanadu','Plates, shafts and bushes for the rice-mill, farm-equipment and sugar-mill workshops of the Cauvery delta, from Thanjavur to Kumbakonam and Pattukkottai.','["Rice mill machinery","Farm equipment","Sugar mills"]','["ms-plates-sheets","en8-steel-round-bars","gunmetal-hollow-bushes","uhmwpe-sheets-rods"]',12),
 ('nagercoil','Nagercoil',245,'1 day','Nagercoil, Konam industrial estate, Marthandam, Colachel','Marine-grade 316 and 5083 aluminium for the boatyards of Colachel, and sections and pipes for the builders of Kanyakumari district, on our Tirunelveli-route truck.','["Building construction","Fishing boat and marine fabrication","Coir processing machinery"]','["ss-316-plates-sheets","aluminium-5083-plates","ms-hollow-sections","ms-erw-black-pipes"]',13);
